            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RTE -->
        <div
          class="home-edition-card"
          style="border-left: 4px solid #96254a;"
        >
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="badge-code" style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #96254a; border-color: #96254a;">
                RTE EDITION
              </span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                Source: <a href="https://github.com/kit119/D-tipitaka" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #96254a; text-decoration: underline;">kit119/D-tipitaka ↗</a>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h2>🇹🇭 Royal Thai Edition (RTE)</h2>
            <p>
              Converted from the SQL database dump at <a href="https://github.com/kit119/D-tipitaka" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #96254a;">kit119/D-tipitaka</a> (45-volume Royal Thai Syāmaraṭṭha Tepiṭakaṃ printed under Rama VII) and transliterated from Thai script to Roman IAST using Aksharamukha, covering all 45 volumes, 21,915 printed pages, and 17,090 variant footnotes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 0.75rem; margin-top: auto; font-size: 0.85rem;">
